  "name": "CULTURED AFB MYCOBACTERIUM OTHER THAN TUBERCULOSIS (MOTT), DST FOR RAPID-GROWERS",
  "code": "2192",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1368\">\n<li data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1207\">\n<p data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1207\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1067\">Positive AFB Culture (MOTT):</strong> Indicates infection/colonization with a non-tuberculous mycobacterium (NTM), commonly seen in immunocompromised or structural lung disease.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1368\">\n<p data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1368\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1244\">Drug Sensitivity Report (DST):</strong> Guides antibiotic treatment; rapid growers (e.g., <em data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1309\">M. abscessus</em>, <em data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1325\">M. fortuitum</em>) often need tailored therapy based on DST.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1375\" data-end=\"1403\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1403\">Clinical Utility:</strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1684\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1570\">\n<p data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1416\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">Helps in:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1570\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1482\">\n<p data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1482\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">Diagnosis of <strong data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1452\">NTM infections</strong> (lung, skin, catheter, etc.).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1525\">\n<p data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1525\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><strong data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1506\">Differentiation</strong> from tuberculosis.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1570\">\n<p data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1570\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">Guiding <strong data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1569\">targeted antibiotic therapy</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 8px;\" data-start=\"1571\" data-end=\"1684\">\n<p data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1684\"><span style=\"font-size: 8px;\">Crucial for patients not responding to anti-TB drugs or with repeat AFB-positive smears but GeneXpert negative.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
